{"headword":"דּוֹר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:5\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.5\">Dt 32:5</a></sup> <strong>period, generation, dwelling (</strong>cf. sub vb. supr.; also NH <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹר</span>, Aramaic (incl. Biblical Aramaic) <span dir=\"rtl\">דָּר</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܕܳܪ</span>, <em>age, generation;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">دَوْرٌ</span> <em>gyrus, orbis, periodus;</em> Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">דר</span>, <em>one time, once</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דרם דרם</span> <em>each once</em> in a year DHM in MV<strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 7:1\" href=\"/Genesis.7.1\">Gn 7:1</a> + 68 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:15\" href=\"/Exodus.3.15\">Ex 3:15</a>; + 36 textual; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:20\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.20\">Dt 32:20</a> + 7 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:15\" href=\"/Exodus.3.15\">Ex 3:15</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹרִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.12\">Is 38:12</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.8\">Is 53:8</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 72:5\" href=\"/Psalms.72.5\">ψ 72:5</a> + 2 times, <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּרוֹת</span> abs. <a data-ref=\"Job 42:16\" href=\"/Job.42.16\">Jb 42:16</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.4\">Is 41:4</a>; cstr. <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:2\" href=\"/Judges.3.2\">Ju 3:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דּוֹרוֹת</span> cstr. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.9\">Is 51:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּרֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 9:12\" href=\"/Genesis.9.12\">Gn 9:12</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּרֹתָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 6:9\" href=\"/Genesis.6.9\">Gn 6:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 25:30\" href=\"/Leviticus.25.30\">Lv 25:30</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ד